            'warn.liquid.contraction_ratio_estimate_clipped': 'The contraction ratio estimated from the throat diameter ({d_t_mm} mm) was {raw}, outside the Huzel & Huang SP-125 Table 1-3 band, so it was clipped to {used} ({band_low}-{band_high}). The correlation is empirical and its primary source is unverified - enter a contraction ratio to override it.',
