            'warn.liquid.npsh_velocity_head_not_met': 'The {propellant} pump inlet head ({npsh_available_m} m) is below the {npsh_required_m} m required by the NASA SP-8109 Sec. 3.2.1.2 inlet velocity-head rule (factor {velocity_head_factor} at {inlet_velocity_ms} m/s). The pump would run cavitated: no impeller geometry is published for it.',
