            'sixdof.help.bodyD': 'Outer body diameter (m). Sets the reference area πd²/4 and scales the fin normal force (span/diameter)² in the Barrowman CP. Must be > 0. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked. Filled from the page vehicle definition when the page publishes one.',
            'sixdof.help.bodyL': 'Total vehicle length from nose tip (m). Must be > 0 and longer than the nose; fin root LE + root chord must fit inside it. Used for the CP/CG diagram and the default fin position. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.noseL': 'Nose cone length (m). The nose CP sits at (nose-type factor × this length) from the tip. Must be > 0 and shorter than the total length. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.noseType': 'Nose shape. Only changes the nose CP factor: ogive 0.466, conical 2/3, parabolic 0.5 (× nose length); the nose normal-force slope stays CN_α = 2.',
            'sixdof.help.finCount': 'Number of fins, 3 or 4. Multiplies the fin normal-force term of the Barrowman CN_α, so it moves the CP and the static margin.',
            'sixdof.help.finRoot': 'Fin root chord (m), the chord along the body. Enters the fin CN_α and fin CP. Must be > 0; root LE + root chord must not exceed the total length. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.finTip': 'Fin tip chord (m). Enters the fin CN_α and fin CP; 0 means a pointed (triangular) fin. Must be ≥ 0. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.finSpan': 'Fin span (m), from the body surface to the fin tip. The fin normal force grows with (span/diameter)². Must be > 0. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.finSweep': 'Fin leading-edge sweep length (m): axial distance from the root LE to the tip LE. Moves the fin CP aft. Must be ≥ 0. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.finPos': 'Distance from the nose tip to the fin root leading edge (m). Places the fin CP. Must be ≥ 0 and (this + root chord) ≤ total length. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.dryMass': 'Vehicle mass without propellant (kg), sent as dry_mass. Must be > 0. Read-only in component mode (sum of non-propellant rows). Filled from the page vehicle definition when the page publishes one. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.propMass': 'Propellant mass burned during the flight (kg), sent as propellant_mass. Must be > 0. When the page calculation supplies the motor it is overwritten with that motor\'s propellant mass; read-only in component mode (sum of propellant rows). Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.cd0': 'Zero-lift (subsonic) drag coefficient, dimensionless, on the reference area πd²/4. Must be > 0 here; the endpoint accepts at most 5. Filled from the page vehicle definition when the page publishes one. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.wind': 'Horizontal wind speed (m/s), added to the airflow seen by the vehicle (drives weathercocking). Must be ≥ 0; the endpoint rejects speeds above the ISA sea-level speed of sound. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.windDir': 'Compass bearing the wind blows FROM (degrees from north). The endpoint accepts 0–360. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.elev': 'Launch rail elevation above the horizon (degrees); 90 is straight up. Must be > 0; the endpoint accepts at most 90. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.azimuth': 'Launch azimuth (degrees from north): the horizontal direction the rail points. Any finite number. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.rail': 'Launch rail length (m). Attitude is locked while the vehicle is on the rail; the result badge shows the rail length the solver used. Must be > 0. Empty or invalid: the field turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.thrust': 'Constant thrust (N), used only when no thrust curve is used (no imported motor file and the computed-curve box is off or unavailable). When the page calculation supplies the motor it is overwritten with that value. Must be > 0 when used.',
            'sixdof.help.burn': 'Burn time (s) of the constant-thrust case, used together with Thrust only when no thrust curve is used. When the page calculation supplies the motor it is overwritten with that value. Must be > 0 when used.',
            'sixdof.help.useCurve': 'On (default): the run flies the thrust curve (or thrust and burn time) of the page calculation, and the Thrust/Burn Time/Propellant Mass fields are filled from it. Off: the form\'s constant Thrust and Burn Time are used. An imported motor file overrides both.',
            'sixdof.help.thrustSource': 'Where thrust comes from. Default: the page calculation (or the form values). Imported: a RASP .eng / RockSim .rse file is parsed by /api/import/motor-file and its thrust curve is flown; if the file holds several motors, the list next to it picks one. Its propellant mass, if given, is written to Propellant Mass for review.',
            'sixdof.help.motorSelect': 'Motor chosen from the imported file (shown only when the file holds more than one); its thrust curve is used for the run.',
            'sixdof.help.modeSimple': 'Simple mode: Dry Mass and Propellant Mass are typed in the form and sent as totals. The choice is remembered in this browser.',
            'sixdof.help.modeComponent': 'Component mode: dry and propellant masses and the full/empty CG are derived from the table below and sent with the component list; the two mass fields become read-only. The choice is remembered in this browser.',
            'sixdof.help.compName': 'Component name, a label for you only; it is not sent to the solver.',
            'sixdof.help.compMass': 'Component mass (kg). Must be > 0; the row turns red otherwise and Run is blocked. Summed into dry or propellant mass and weighted into the CG.',
            'sixdof.help.compX': 'Component CG position measured from the nose tip (m). Must be between 0 and the total length; otherwise the row turns red and Run is blocked.',
            'sixdof.help.compProp': 'Ticked: the row is propellant — counted in propellant mass and in the full CG but not in the empty (burnout) CG.',
