            'transient.feedMode': 'Feed Mode',
            'transient.feedModeTip': 'How the oxidizer reaches the injector in this time march. Regulated: the oxidizer mass flow is held at its design value for the whole burn; no tank is modelled, so the fill fraction changes nothing and the tank temperature only enters as the N2O inlet temperature. N2O blowdown: a self-pressurising N2O tank holding the design oxidizer mass drives the flow; as it empties, tank pressure, thrust and Pc fall and the run can end before the design burn time (the end event is marked on the chart). Blowdown is disabled when the main design uses a user-set tank pressure. Choices: Regulated (default) or N2O blowdown.',
