            'panel.feed.help.slosh.baffle_depth_ratio': 'Baffle depth below the free surface as a fraction of the radius, d/R. Sets the ring-baffle damping (Miles 1958). Not filled from the motor result. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.slosh.baffle_width_ratio': 'Ring baffle width as a fraction of the tank radius, w/R. Sets the ring-baffle damping (Miles 1958). Not filled from the motor result. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.slosh.fill_height': 'Liquid fill height, m. Enters the sloshing frequency and mass. Filled with 90 % of the oxidizer tank length after a calculation, unless you edit it. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.slosh.fluid_density': 'Propellant density, kg/m³. Sets the sloshing mass and forces. Filled with the oxidizer density after a calculation, unless you edit it. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.slosh.g_eff': 'Axial acceleration, m/s². Restoring acceleration of the slosh modes. Not filled from the motor result. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.slosh.radius': 'Tank radius, m. /api/slosh-analysis uses it for the sloshing modes. Filled with half the oxidizer tank diameter after a calculation, unless you edit it. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.water_hammer.fluid': 'Fluid in the feed line. /api/water-hammer takes its density and bulk modulus (wave speed). Not filled from the motor result.',
