            'panel.feed.help.water_hammer.line_length_m': 'Feed line length, m. Sets the pressure-wave round-trip time (sudden vs slow closure). Not filled from the motor result. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
            'panel.feed.help.water_hammer.mdot_kg_s': 'Line mass flow, kg/s. Sets the flow velocity that is stopped by the valve. Filled with the oxidizer flow after a calculation, unless you edit it. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
