            'panel.feed.help.water_hammer.working_pressure_bar': 'Line working pressure, bar. The surge is added to it for the peak-pressure verdict. Filled with the chamber pressure after a calculation, unless you edit it. Blank: the field is not sent and the endpoint applies its own rule.',
